WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:02.067
(bubbles burst)

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:04.067
(gasps)

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.300
- I've done a lot of
dumb things for videos

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.080
but this one might just be the dumbest.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.980
Hi, I'm Dakota and for the next week,

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.000
this bathtub is gonna be my home.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.658
Why did I sign up for this?

00:00:13.658 --> 00:00:16.470
(New Orleans jazz music)

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.670
You might be asking yourself, "Why?"

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:19.600
Well, it's pretty simple.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.880
I work at Buzzfeed and
I'm running out of ideas.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.530
I am gonna stay in this bathtub

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.370
for a whole week with a few exceptions.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:26.790
I can leave to use the toilet,

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.400
because I am not waffle stomping

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.950
and when my roommate
needs to take a shower.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.630
I'm also not gonna have water
in the tub the whole time,

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.940
because, as I learned that would kill me.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.605
For everything else, though,
I am sticking right here.

00:00:36.605 --> 00:00:38.540
What am I getting myself into?

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.860
Goodbye outside world.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.992
Bye!

00:00:41.992 --> 00:00:44.140
(water sloshes)
Oh, that's really hot.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.313
Shouldn't have started with a full tub.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.428
(exhales slowly)

00:00:50.428 --> 00:00:53.320
Oh, that's hot. That's really hot.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.680
(exhales)

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.230
So I didn't go into this
completely unprepared.

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.160
I did bring a few things into this room

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.840
to make myself as comfortable as possible

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.560
because I don't wanna
just survive in here,

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.600
I wanna thrive.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.560
Everything that I use in
this video is gonna be linked

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:07.810
in the description down below

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.910
in case you want to do
something as dumb as I am

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:12.030
or just to try any of those things out.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.520
To start, I have a cushion behind me.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.060
This tray here is
basically gonna be my desk

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.760
where I can use my keyboard and mouse.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.560
I also have this little
waterproof notepad next to me

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.020
because if I am in this
bathtub for a week,

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.930
I am bound to have some
incredible shower thoughts.

00:01:26.930 --> 00:01:28.530
I don't wanna forget them.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.377
The coolest thing of all, check this out.

00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:33.638
(machine whirs)

00:01:33.638 --> 00:01:34.953
(bubbles pop)

00:01:34.953 --> 00:01:35.786
I got a jacuzzi!

00:01:35.786 --> 00:01:37.186
I forget how to turn it off.

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:39.563
There we go.

00:01:39.563 --> 00:01:42.040
And then, of course I have a
rubber duck to keep me company.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.000
Outside of the tub is where
things get interesting, though.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.650
I have a little rack over here
to hold all of my provisions

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.797
and I have this really cute
little Frigidaire refrigerator

00:01:50.797 --> 00:01:54.050
that I am keeping some
of the colder foods in.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.530
And then the entertainment center.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:58.210
LG was nice enough to send me out one

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:00.050
of their SHort Throw CineBeam projectors,

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.680
which is really great because it works

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.560
in a small, confined space.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.030
That's gonna be basically
my monitor as well

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:08.490
as how I watch movies
and play video games.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:09.870
And yes, I know it's overkill,

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:12.510
but I figured if I can, why not?

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.670
I'm the only person I know

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.400
with a home theater in my bathroom.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.950
Here goes a week.

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:17.933
What do I do?

00:02:18.941 --> 00:02:21.260
Next thing I think--
(door knocks)

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.350
Yeah?

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.500
- [Will] Can I take a piss?

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.423
- Yeah.

00:02:26.423 --> 00:02:27.290
(shower curtain whooshes)

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.231
Well, we're gonna get closer
than we ever thought we would.

00:02:30.231 --> 00:02:31.602
(loud thud)

00:02:31.602 --> 00:02:32.599
(laughs)

00:02:32.599 --> 00:02:34.080
(toilet flushes)

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.522
- [Will] Good doing business with you.

00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:40.122
- And you. (laughs)

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.070
I'd say this has been a
pretty successful day one.

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:44.980
I'm just kinda getting used to it

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.590
and hopefully I can get some sleep.

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:48.389
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:02:48.389 --> 00:02:50.972
(upbeat music)

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.800
I did not sleep well.

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.330
All of my joints hurt.

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:03.330
I am six foot two, and this tub
is less than five feet long.

00:03:03.518 --> 00:03:04.351
(neck cracks)

00:03:04.351 --> 00:03:06.672
Ooh, that gives you an
idea of what it feels like.

00:03:06.672 --> 00:03:09.172
(silly music)

00:03:10.085 --> 00:03:11.980
(grunts)

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.300
Will is pretty busy in meetings today,

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.247
so I can't rely on him to bring me food,

00:03:15.247 --> 00:03:17.820
but I set up something really cool

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:20.003
and I am excited to show it to you.

00:03:20.003 --> 00:03:21.168
Just watch this.

00:03:21.168 --> 00:03:24.710
All right and order placed.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.560
I ordered from Shake Shack.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.565
It's only three blocks away.

00:03:28.565 --> 00:03:30.200
(silly music)

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.033
Okay, the guy just buzzed.

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:32.992
I am going to let him in.

00:03:32.992 --> 00:03:36.242
(little machine whirs)

00:03:41.511 --> 00:03:42.678
I've got this.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.823
Let's see if this works.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.330
I think it's coming!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.360
Let's see if I can reach this.

00:03:56.212 --> 00:03:58.795
(bag clatters)

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:02.520
(laughs)

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.891
Lunch!

00:04:03.891 --> 00:04:05.362
(straw squeaks)

00:04:05.362 --> 00:04:06.361
Delicious.

00:04:06.361 --> 00:04:08.633
(New Orleans jazz music)

00:04:08.633 --> 00:04:10.910
I've got a few meetings today

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.660
and I'm wondering if I should
take them with the water.

00:04:14.574 --> 00:04:17.500
(curtain whooshes)

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.652
Hey!

00:04:18.652 --> 00:04:20.490
- Well, well, well.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:22.920
- See, I've got the
jacuzzi, it's bubbling.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:25.220
I'm gonna turn the jacuzzi
off 'cause it's quite loud.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.440
Oh, that just turned it louder.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.970
Oh no, how do I, okay, wait,
no, that turned it back on.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.560
Oh no! Off.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:32.020
Why does it keep turning back on?

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:32.853
Stop?

00:04:32.853 --> 00:04:33.780
I think it turned off.

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:35.430
- The last thing I need to happen is

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:38.423
for this to short circuit
while I'm on video with you.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:40.520
- Important update.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.780
I posted on Instagram asking
what I should name my duck.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.660
And I've decided to name him Arnold.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.690
Hey Arnold.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:48.050
What's the point of being in the tub

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.350
unless you're gonna hang
out and relax in it?

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.810
So I have lit some candles for myself.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:53.860
I'm just gonna relax and see

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.550
if I can get a better
night's sleep tonight.

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:56.953
Really hoping I can.

00:04:58.699 --> 00:05:01.449
(peaceful music)

00:05:05.084 --> 00:05:07.120
I'm standing up 'cause
I just took a shower

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.600
and I'm still waiting for the tub to dry.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.848
But last night was really rough.

00:05:10.848 --> 00:05:15.570
I felt like every part of my
body was in the wrong position.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.690
Also, one thing I hadn't considered is

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:20.960
that I shouldn't take a bath
right before I wanna go to bed

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.620
because then I have to
wait for the tub to dry

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:26.990
before I can put my pillow
and blankets in here.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:30.660
(strings pizzicato)

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.160
I can't afford to keep ordering food,

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.518
so today I'm gonna bring
a toaster in the tub.

00:05:34.518 --> 00:05:35.351
(electricity short circuits)

00:05:35.351 --> 00:05:36.184
I'm just kidding.

00:05:36.184 --> 00:05:38.310
But I am gonna make some avocado toast.

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.890
Avocado, bread.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:40.880
What more do you need?

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:42.784
I forgot to bring plates in here.

00:05:42.784 --> 00:05:45.284
(fridge hums)

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.080
This thing got very hot,
very quickly. (laughs)

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.273
Let's toast.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.413
Yeah.

00:05:58.201 --> 00:06:01.056
Look at that, that's beautiful.

00:06:01.056 --> 00:06:01.889
Look at that, it's beautiful.

00:06:01.889 --> 00:06:02.722
Breakfast.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.140
I feel like later I'm gonna
be bathing in bits of egg.

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.510
This is the reason the housing market

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.523
is in shambles and I have
to live in a bathtub.

00:06:09.523 --> 00:06:12.250
It's the damn millennials
and their avocado toasts.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.833
(upbeat music)

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.840
I realize I've been so rude.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.620
I've been asking Will for all this help.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.190
He's been getting me
food and I haven't even

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.680
invited him in here to watch
a movie or anything. (laughs)

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:25.513
Hey, Will!

00:06:26.358 --> 00:06:27.240
- Yeah?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.230
- Do you wanna watch a movie
and drink a beer in here?

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:32.391
- Yeah.
(both laugh)

00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:33.263
- Cheers.

00:06:33.263 --> 00:06:38.263
- Cheers.
(movie plays)

00:06:40.018 --> 00:06:41.990
Oh yeah, baby.

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:43.340
- Day three complete.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:46.000
I am not looking forward
to trying to sleep tonight.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.560
I am very tired, though, so
hopefully that will help.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.600
3:30 in the morning, I've barely slept,

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:53.024
and I did exactly what I was afraid of

00:06:53.024 --> 00:06:56.528
and started dribbling
water all over the pillow.

00:06:56.528 --> 00:06:59.340
I just need clean up the
water, go back to bed.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:00.886
I can sleep a little bit.

00:07:00.886 --> 00:07:02.969
(sighs)

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.694
I woke up today and I hurt everywhere.

00:07:10.694 --> 00:07:14.400
My back is sore, my legs
are completely cramped up.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.830
I don't know if I can demonstrate this,

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.994
but my legs have to be
completely bent like this

00:07:18.994 --> 00:07:21.400
in order to fit in this tub.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.280
And over the course of the night,

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.430
I feel like it's
constricting the blood flow

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:26.650
and it's just like making me cramp up.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:29.610
I just wanna stretch them,
but I have nowhere to do that.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.500
And so I wake up constantly.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.520
I need to move around, like actually walk.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.380
So while my roommate takes
a shower this morning,

00:07:37.380 --> 00:07:38.750
I'm gonna go for a quick walk.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:43.244
I'm not giving up, I just
need to move for 20 minutes.

00:07:43.244 --> 00:07:44.913
It's so nice out.

00:07:46.515 --> 00:07:48.668
Why do I have to go back into this tub?

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:50.668
(sighs)

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.773
(somber music)

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:55.983
I don't wanna get back in there.

00:08:01.648 --> 00:08:04.700
(blows raspberry)

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:05.533
Halfway done.

00:08:06.838 --> 00:08:09.421
(upbeat music)

00:08:14.268 --> 00:08:15.590
(spoon clinks)

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.730
So if this is gonna be my home,

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.230
I figure I might as well start decorating.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.923
So I've been adding some art to the walls.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:26.570
This one I call Lost Arnold and this one

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:29.070
is what I think paradise looks like.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.450
There's no bathtubs there.

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:33.020
And I'm currently drawing
the view out my window

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.460
if I could see out my window.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:36.818
I will start the bidding at $1 million.

00:08:36.818 --> 00:08:38.070
(cash register rings)
I'm doing great.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:39.360
I have to finish editing a video today,

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:41.400
but after that, I think
I'm going to take the rest

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:44.030
of the day off and just relax.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:46.120
I'm gonna go live on Twitch,

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:49.583
and stream myself playing
video games from my bathtub.

00:08:49.583 --> 00:08:51.647
(water rushes)

00:08:51.647 --> 00:08:53.181
It's raining. I'm
already wet in real life.

00:08:53.181 --> 00:08:56.433
I don't need to get wet in Minecraft

00:08:56.433 --> 00:09:01.433
Ow, I don't have much health left, dammit!

00:09:01.997 --> 00:09:04.107
(groans) Oh it's wet!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.870
I got some of it up my nose.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:08.760
That stream tonight was really fun.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.370
I actually enjoyed myself
and I kind of forgot

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:12.900
what I was doing for a little bit.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.490
And it kind of just made me realize that,

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.890
yeah, I can do this.

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:19.291
It's gonna be hard, it has
been hard, but it's possible

00:09:19.291 --> 00:09:23.473
and I'm almost there.
(uplifting music)

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.070
Good morning from day five.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:29.170
I just took a shower if you couldn't tell.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.090
Last night, I decided to sleep sitting up,

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.700
which I usually try to
avoid because I can never

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.280
stay asleep long that way.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:36.470
I can't sleep on buses
or planes or anything.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:38.840
However, maybe it's because
the last few nights of sleep

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.760
have been truly awful, or
maybe I'm just built different,

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.120
but I managed to just sleep
mostly through the night.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.400
Also it's Friday, which means
I've just got a few days left

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:48.033
of this and then I'm free.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.700
I was sitting here trying to figure out

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.460
what to do with my day and it struck me

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.720
that Arnold needed a friend.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:58.270
And so I've been converting
this shampoo bottle

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:59.750
into a friend for Arnold.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.149
Her name is Dove.

00:10:01.149 --> 00:10:02.000
("Wedding March" plays)
They're getting married

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.810
and all the soaps are invited.

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:06.210
Just look at them so happy together.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.538
(music slows)

00:10:07.538 --> 00:10:08.934
(bottles thud)
Whoops.

00:10:08.934 --> 00:10:10.593
(imitates kissing)

00:10:10.593 --> 00:10:11.832
(broadcast signal)

00:10:11.832 --> 00:10:13.740
I wonder how long I can
hold my breath under water.

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.012
I'm gonna try it.

00:10:15.012 --> 00:10:17.762
(inhales deeply)

00:10:21.041 --> 00:10:22.646
(bubbles burst)

00:10:22.646 --> 00:10:23.825
(gasps)

00:10:23.825 --> 00:10:27.821
I'm out of practice, but not terrible.

00:10:27.821 --> 00:10:28.654
I invented a game.

00:10:28.654 --> 00:10:32.417
Since I have a tennis ball and
I have a roll of tape here,

00:10:32.417 --> 00:10:34.981
and all you have to do is
bounce the tennis ball off this

00:10:34.981 --> 00:10:36.550
and into the roll.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:37.710
I'm really bad at it.

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:40.127
(ball thuds)

00:10:41.201 --> 00:10:42.034
(gasps)

00:10:42.034 --> 00:10:44.701
(fanfare plays)

00:10:46.794 --> 00:10:48.370
Let's call my mom.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:49.520
She picked up!

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:50.380
- What's up?

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:52.079
- I just wanted to call and say hi.

00:10:52.079 --> 00:10:52.912
- You're in your bathroom.

00:10:52.912 --> 00:10:53.940
- I am in my bathroom.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.748
My home theater set up over there.

00:10:55.748 --> 00:10:56.750
- That's great, right over the toilet.

00:10:57.661 --> 00:10:58.660
- Yeah, it's perfect.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:11:00.590
- Aren't you out of there yet?

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.091
Your mother's worried
about your wellbeing.

00:11:03.091 --> 00:11:05.513
- I'm gonna be fine, don't worry.

00:11:05.513 --> 00:11:06.591
- Are you comfortable.

00:11:06.591 --> 00:11:08.320
- Um, sure.

